  "full_text": "I'm gonna eat an apple because I need an apple. Hey, Dad's back. Dad's back. Did you just get these off the tree? Are there more of them? I think that's the tree. Sunshine. So I kept biting my lip like the hamburger was really good and then like pleasures and pains balance so like stay away from those that picnic was a bad idea because those sweets and stuff maybe this is good so I kept biting my lip fuck couldn't believe it so uh so I was eating this spaghetti really fast and I was like biting my lip and then I got to thinking maybe you're supposed to savor it and There's grace if you uh, oh Oh my god, you broke that I stepped on it broke it. So maybe there's grace in Like proper table manners and stuff like if you eat like sitting correctly then the the discipline of Holding your posture and all that maybe that offsets the food pleasure I think that if I was eating fast that's what made me bite my lip you're supposed to slow down and savor it it's not quite pleasure pleasures and pains something slightly different",
